{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41378","headline":"塞上 · 赵延寿","name":"塞上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄沙风卷半空抛，云动阴山雪满郊。\n探水人回移帐就，射鵰箭落着弓抄。\n鸟逢霜果饥还啄，马渡冰河渴自跑。\n占得高原肥草地，夜深生火折林梢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}